008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1820110008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我们知道这件事，是因为她曾经托那些游商，给我妈妈寄过一...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:11:624:0":{"key":"document:11:624:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嗨，我最最最亲爱的珊多拉，你最近还好吗？\n真对不起，过了这么久才给你们来信。我找了好几个地方，才找到这个游商能给你们寄信。\n你们是不是很想我？别担心，我一切都好！\n亡灵的生活很幸福，在这里我能跑、能跳，每天都有很多时间干自己想做的事。我比活着的时候还开心！\n唯一的遗憾，就是不能见到你们。\n不过换个角度想一想，原本带来恐惧的死亡，其实是和家人的重逢……哈哈，这么一想，死亡是不是也没有那么可怕了？\n算啦，先不说这个了！对了，我最近还准备搬去新家呢。\n总之，我现在一切安好，大家放心吧！\n——永远爱你们的，莎柏琳\n顺便一提，我的新地址是<style=\"highlight\">诺珐斯郡，称骨广场西街一号</style>。那里有一棵很高的树，旁边就是我的新家啦！\n如果未来几十年后，我们有机会在这里重逢的话，记得来看看我哦！","textdes_id":"624","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"我一切都好！","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item13.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item13.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:12:1820110009:1":{"key":"say:12:1820110009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1820110009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……话是这么说，但我们怎么可能不担心嘛！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1820110010:1":{"key":"say:13:1820110010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":